@startuml UC-45 Download Assigned Material - Sequence Diagram (stereo)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280

actor Student
participant ":ResourceDetailPage" as UI <<user interaction>>
participant ":ClassController" as CTL <<coordinator>>
participant ":ClassResourceService" as SVC <<business logic>>
participant ":ClassResourceRepository" as REPO <<interface>>
database DB
participant "File Storage Service" as STORAGE

autonumber
activate Student
Student ->> UI : Open a class resource that carries an attached material
activate UI
UI ->> UI : load()
UI ->> CTL : GET /api/classes/{id}/resources
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : listResources(classId, page, size)
activate SVC
SVC ->> SVC : allow only the class owner or a student still enrolled in the class
SVC ->> REPO : findByClassId(classId, page, size)
activate REPO
REPO ->> DB : SELECT * FROM class_resources WHERE class_id = ? ORDER BY created_at DESC
activate DB
DB -->> REPO : resource rows with the stored attachment URL
deactivate DB
REPO -->> SVC : PageResult
deactivate REPO
SVC -->> CTL : ClassResourcePage
deactivate SVC
CTL -->> UI : HTTP 200 + ClassResourcePage
deactivate CTL
UI -->> Student : Show the attachment name and size with a Download action, also when the class is INACTIVE

Student ->> UI : Click Download on the attached material
UI ->> STORAGE : Request the material from the stored attachment URL
activate STORAGE
STORAGE -->> UI : File content with its content type / retrieval error
deactivate STORAGE

alt the resource carries no attachment or the storage service cannot return the file
  UI -->> Student : Hide the Download action or show the failure message (MSG25), leaving the resource unchanged
else the storage service returns the file
  UI -->> Student : Save the file to the chosen or default download folder
end
deactivate UI
deactivate Student
@enduml
